  "method": "Read-only original input. Generate temporary atlases with GGO_GRAY2/4/8 and mode|GGO_UNHINTED; compare grayscale absolute errors and halfcoverage masks with boundedalignment. Generate2x/4x monochromeGDIatlases, boxfilter withboundedsubpixel phases; compare using highresadvances and original lowresinteger advances.",
